Title: NEXUS ZERO: SYNTHETIC TEARS
Genre: Sci-Fi / Cyberpunk
Recommended Style: Neo-Noir Neon & Concept Art Digital

EXT. SECTOR 4 SKYWALK - NIGHT - PERPETUAL RAIN
[STYLE: Neo-Noir Neon | LIGHTING: Volumetric Neon Cyan and Amber]

Endless vertical cityscapes reach into toxic violet clouds. Flying spinner vehicles streak through holographic advertisements for artificial memories.

BLADE RETRIEVER DECKARD (40s, battered leather duster, cybernetic eye overlay) leans against a wet balcony rail.

DECKARD
(lighting a synthetic cigarette)
You can wipe their memory chips ten times over. But blood remembers what the silicon forgot.

MAYA (20s, synthetic replicant, platinum hair, luminescent skin tattoos) steps out of the steam vent behind him.

MAYA
We aren't running from your department anymore, Deckard. We're waiting for you.
